//
// Canonical Xeto sys::Unit name = reasonCode|review note
// Every catalog unit appears in a mapped file or this file, never both.
//

// Xeto defines obsolete BYR; the current Belarusian ruble BYN is not in this catalog.
belarussian_ruble=noEquivalent|QUDT 2.1 currency graph does not contain obsolete ISO 4217 code BYR
